  ('ACT', $q$ACT English$q$, $q$Writing strategy$q$, 'mc', $q$Sentence 1: The county's first public library opened in a single rented room in 1890. Sentence 2: Today, every town in the county has its own branch. Sentence 3: Over the next century, more towns raised money to build libraries of their own.$q$, $q$For the paragraph to be most logical, Sentence 3 should be placed:$q$, $q$["between Sentences 1 and 2", "before Sentence 1", "after Sentence 2, at the end of the paragraph", "where it is now"]$q$::jsonb, 0, $q$The paragraph moves in time order: first library, more towns over time, today.$q$),
