Still, the old diagram lived on in textbooks for decades, a reminder that even simple scientific claims deserve a second look.$q$, $q$According to the passage, holding your nose while eating a jelly bean makes you likely to notice only that it is:$q$, $q$["sour", "sweet", "bitter", "salty"]$q$::jsonb, 1, $q$Paragraph 2 says you'll notice only that it is sweet.$q$),
